# Every 15 min: one `heartbeat` row per 'usage providers' line in the sd
# database, the Usage view's feed (system sd:9256). Claude per cswap
# account, Codex from its session logs, every other provider through its
# own usage or balance API with its key from ~/.config/shell/env.sh; a
# failed read is `unknown`, a provider with no usage API `no-source`,
# a provider the list no longer names `removed`.
# The list is the setting row dashboard.usage_providers (Settings); a
# store that never held it starts with the providers agent-meter knows.
# Hub only: the rows go to the hub's database. It writes no ledger line;
# agent-meter.job keeps the four-hourly ledger.
# SD_PACK_ROOT is escaped so the `bash -c` that runs the command reads it,
# after ~/.config/shell/env.sh; this file is sourced before env.sh is.
JOB_SCHEDULE="*/15 * * * *"
JOB_TIMEOUT="10m"
JOB_COMMAND="\"\${SD_PACK_ROOT:-\$HOME/repos/platypeeps/sd-workflow}/.venv/bin/python\" \"$ROOT/../local-agent-meter/agent-meter.py\" usage"
JOB_DIR="$ROOT/../local-agent-meter"
JOB_PROMPT=""
JOB_MODEL=""
JOB_CLAUDE_ARGS=""
